    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, the astrologian has mastered basic fortunetelling, allowing her to manipulate fate in her readings to a certain extent. After using the Draw ability, she may use a free action to redraw from the deck, effectively rerolling. The drawn card is returned to the deck to be read another day, and she may use the Draw ability again. She may use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + her Wisdom modifier.</p>",
